## What to deliver

Build the sink sprite sheet up operation by operation until each
`frames/<index>.png` matches the brief: a top-down test-fixture drain housing with
a West intake aperture and a red drain indicator, playing a consume pulse where a
single steel-grey item arrives from the West and is swallowed in with a red flash,
frames 0→5 looping seamlessly. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded
per-frame action logs are your finished submission.
